  (text "DRV8316CR notes (datasheet SLVSH07):\n- Internal buck is unused but its pins may not float (8.3.4): resistor mode, R10 22R + C26.\n  Firmware: set BUCK_CL=1 or BUCK_DIS=1 over SPI.\n- VREF tied to AVDD (3.3 V): SOx = VREF/2 +/- GAIN x I. Set GAIN over SPI (1.2 V/A suits a gimbal motor).\n- nFAULT pulled up to AVDD: must be >2.2 V at power-up or the part enters test mode.\n- nSLEEP pulled low (R13): driver sleeps until GPIO34 goes high.\n- DRVOFF pulled high (R14): outputs Hi-Z until GPIO35 goes low.\n- Layout: one of C20-C22 at each VM pin (9/10/11); C24, C25, C27, C28 tight to their pins.\n  Thermal pad (41) to a solid GND plane with vias."
    (at 228.6 111.76 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e23842ea-3134-4127-8cf5-77e0d62ce572")
  )
